{"id":"9ad57dde38e024b0","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-impposet.md","title":"Implicant poset","display":"df-impposet — Implicant poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-impposet","aliases":["27-df-impposet"],"display":"df-impposet — Implicant poset","depends_on":["[[27-df-impset]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-impposet"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-impposet</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-impposet — Implicant poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span>；函数和项的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a> 及其上游。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" href=\"?note=e9e30bad3bbd56ff\" title=\"27-df-impset\">27-df-impset</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImplicantPoset}\">\\(\\mathrm{ImplicantPoset}\\)</span> (poset-valued map)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\leq U\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\,(T(x)\\leq U(x)),\\qquad\\mathrm{ImplicantPoset}(f)\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\{(T,U)\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)^2\\mid\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(T(x)\\leq U(x))\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\leq U\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\,(T(x)\\leq U(x)),\\qquad\\mathrm{ImplicantPoset}(f)\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\{(T,U)\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)^2\\mid\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(T(x)\\leq U(x))\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\)</span> is the set of maximal elements of this poset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-impset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n$；函数和项的类型见 [[27-df-impset]] 及其上游。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-impset","status":"resolved","id":"e9e30bad3bbd56ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Imp}(f)$ (see [[27-df-impset]]) and $\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ (see [[27-df-piset]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Imp}(f)$ (see [[27-df-impset]]) and $\\mathrm{PI}(f)$ (see [[27-df-piset]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T,U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImplicantPoset}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\leq U\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\,(T(x)\\leq U(x)),\\qquad\\mathrm{ImplicantPoset}(f)\\coloneqq\\left(\\mathrm{Imp}(f),\\{(T,U)\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)^2\\mid\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(T(x)\\leq U(x))\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)","display":false}],"bytes":958,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-impposet|df-impposet — Implicant poset]]"}],"outgoing":["e9e30bad3bbd56ff","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}